# Left out of searches (ripgrep, and the Grep and Glob tools of coding agents, read this file), but kept in git: big generated or archived files that
# fill a search with noise and spend the model's context. To search them on purpose, name the folder: `rg <term> specs/001-migracao-entregas-dos-times/sources`
# (a folder given by name is searched), or `rg --no-ignore`. Build output (dist/, examples/test-room/base) is already out by .gitignore.

# the teams' deliveries as they came (minified bundles and pages of several MB): read when porting a delivery (CLAUDE.md section 1)
specs/001-migracao-entregas-dos-times/sources/
specs/001-migracao-entregas-dos-times/artefatos/
# the visual test report (a 20 MB html, prints and results)
specs/003-teste-visual/
# prints, thumbnails and logs written by the page tests
**/shots/
site/thumbs/
# recorded goldens and big data tables the tests compare with
**/tests/fixtures/team-golden/
packages/game-weapons-three/tests/fixtures/audio-trace.json
tools/golden/fixtures/audio/
packages/game-audio/src/data/fitted-sfx.json
packages/game-items-three/preview-lot-b.svg
# images and sounds are never searched as text
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.ogg
